{"id":"275ee98c00f161f8","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-conditional-plain-count.md","title":"Conditional Counting in Finite Sets","display":"thm-conditional-plain-count — Conditional Counting in Finite Sets","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-conditional-plain-count","aliases":["43-thm-conditional-plain-count"],"display":"thm-conditional-plain-count — Conditional Counting in Finite Sets","depends_on":["[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","[[43-df-string]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 6.2.2(i)","source_printed_pages":"91","source_pdf_pages":"111","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-conditional-plain-count"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-conditional-plain-count</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-conditional-plain-count — Conditional Counting in Finite Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 6.2.2(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"91"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"111"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(A\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是非空有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\sigma\\in A\\;C(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\ge\\lfloor\\log_2|A|\\rfloor.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\sigma\\in A\\;C(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\ge\\lfloor\\log_2|A|\\rfloor.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用显式向下取整避免草稿对整数对数取整约定的不一致：长度小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lfloor\\log_2|A|\\rfloor\">\\(\\lfloor\\log_2|A|\\rfloor\\)</span> 的程序少于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span>。对任意单元素集合结论为复杂度非负。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 6.2.2(i)；印刷页 91，PDF 页 111。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-condplainkolm","status":"resolved","id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condplainkolm","status":"resolved","id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$ 是非空有限集，$\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*$；$C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$ 见 [[43-df-condplainkolm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\sigma\\in A\\;C(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)\\ge\\lfloor\\log_2|A|\\rfloor.","display":true},{"tex":"\\lfloor\\log_2|A|\\rfloor","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false}],"bytes":1298,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-conditional-plain-count]] — Conditional Counting in Finite Sets"}],"outgoing":["e79ea45002ccf795","1cb4649e6af56ba4"]}